    "title": "Shamrock Shuffle to take place this Saturday - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Calahan Steed ,\n1 days ago MADISON, Wis. (WMTV) - It’s a run, walk and bike event that helps change lives. The Shamrock Shuffle is a 10K bike, a 10K run or a 5K walk that will take place this Saturday. The event will run from 8 to 9:30 a.m. at the 600 block of State Street. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
